{
 "id": "create:chassis/linear_attachment",
 "schematic": "chassis/linear_attachment",
 "schematicNamespace": "create",
 "title": "Attaching blocks using Linear Chassis",
 "texts": {
  "text_1": "The open faces of a Linear Chassis can be made Sticky",
  "text_2": "Click again to make the opposite side sticky",
  "text_3": "Sneak and Right-Click with an empty hand to remove the slime",
  "text_4": "Stickied faces of the Linear Chassis will attach a line of blocks in front of it",
  "text_5": "Using a Wrench, a precise Range can be specified for this chassis",
  "text_6": "Holding CTRL adjusts the range of all connected Chassis Blocks",
  "text_7": "Attaching blocks to any other side requires the use of Super Glue",
  "text_8": "Using these mechanics, structures of any shape can move as a Contraption"
 },
